# Ending early. An acting minion that leaves the ready region before blocks are resolved ends its
# action, the blocker not locked (rulebook, "Resolve the Action"; zero-vtes docs/rules-digest.md
# §24.3, checked at 1f33be5): ended before resolution, it has no after-resolution window (§3.2).
# A combat ended early by a card (Saulot's Guiding Wisdom) resolves no strike, but its
# end-of-round window still opens (rules-qa 19.5).
# Alice plays first; her prey is Bob. Long Reach is an action card.
seed 26
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Long Reach" *40
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *40
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *12
library C "Signal Fire" *40
start

A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> transfer +4 A:ready:1
A> transfer +4 A:ready:2
B> transfer +4 B:ready:1
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

# Vera bleeds Bob with Long Reach. Bob tries to block; then, with a card effect, he sends Vera to
# torpor before the block resolves (the players' move). The action ends at once: Tomas isn't
# locked, Long Reach is spent, and there's no window after it.
A> bleed A:ready:1 with A:hand:1
B> block B:ready:1
B> move A:ready:1 torpor
log public The action ends: the acting minion left the ready region
expect action none
expect window none
expect card B:ready:1 locked false
expect count A:ashHeap 1
expect count A:hand 7
expect pool B 26

# The other vampire bleeds; Bob blocks, and the combat starts. In the strikes, a card ends the
# combat (Saulot's Guiding Wisdom, say): Bob ends it. No strike resolves, but the end of the round
# comes first, where cards may still be played.
A> bleed A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
expect action bleed A combat
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
B> pass
expect combat 1 strikes close
A> strike hand
B> endcombat
log public B ended the combat: no strike resolves; the end of the round, then it's over
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
expect card A:ready:1 blood 4
expect card B:ready:1 blood 4
reject:no-change B> endcombat
A> pass
B> pass
log public Combat is over; the action was blocked
A> pass
expect action none
